154 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 107 0 R
/E (It may seem counter-productive, but it is not: playing free is the best way to connect to our inner creativity and train our ears. Start your practice by playing at least 10 minutes of completely FREE music.  10 minutes is a long time, so it will force you to dive deep into our creative mind, and accept the unknown, the less expected. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
