156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 107 0 R
/E (It is hard to listen to ourselves playing free, there's a lot of frustration. However, try to concentrate on the moments in which you sounded good. The title of your voice memo can specify the minute in which you had a good idea \(for example "check out the chord on 3'15''\), you will be surprised by how many good ideas you will come up with. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
